{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"banner","type":"text","x":0,"y":-200,"width":2760,"height":110,"color":"6","text":"## 子图③｜范式定位 × 行为编码先例（H+I 板块·第 2/3 轮扩展）　→　返回主图：`论文知识主图_L1`　｜　全文：`实践型研究范式_第2轮` + `行为编码先例_第3轮`"},
		{"id":"h_main","type":"text","x":0,"y":0,"width":420,"height":170,"color":"3","text":"# H｜实践型研究范式\n\n回答「这不就是作业吗」\npractice-led + RtD"},
		{"id":"h1","type":"text","x":540,"y":-20,"width":680,"height":180,"color":"3","text":"H1｜Candy 2006《Practice Based Research: A Guide》UTS\n被引 464+ 的权威定义\npractice-based＝作品即知识贡献（去作品论文不完整）\npractice-led＝知识可文字表达（作品可选）"},
		{"id":"h2","type":"text","x":540,"y":200,"width":680,"height":180,"color":"3","text":"H2｜Frayling 1993《Research in Art and Design》RCA 1(1)\ninto / for / through 三分法\n你的实验＝research through design 经典款"},
		{"id":"h4","type":"text","x":540,"y":420,"width":680,"height":180,"color":"3","text":"H4｜Biggs & Büchler 2008\nArt, Design & Communication in HE 7(1):5-18\n实践型研究八条合格标准\n⭐开题自查清单：研究问题/方法/可审查数据/可迁移结论/文献定位"},
		{"id":"h_pos","type":"text","x":540,"y":640,"width":680,"height":220,"color":"2","text":"★范式定位（已冻结）\n\n本研究 = practice-led research（Candy 2006）\n+ research through design（Frayling 1993）\n\n创作物＝证据非主张\n「不是作业」五条反驳见 md 全文"},
		{"id":"f_hpack","type":"file","file":"AI问题解决Canvas/实践型研究范式_第2轮_STAGING.md","x":0,"y":640,"width":420,"height":180,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"i_main","type":"text","x":1560,"y":0,"width":420,"height":170,"color":"4","text":"# I｜行为编码先例（FACS）\n\n回答「CBEC 是不是玄学」\n40 年科学实践 + 动画工业先例"},
		{"id":"i1","type":"text","x":2100,"y":-20,"width":660,"height":190,"color":"4","text":"I1｜FACS（Ekman & Friesen 1978；Ekman, Friesen & Hager 2002）\n46 个动作单元 AU＝最小可视觉判别动作\n★纯描述：action 与 inference 分离，情绪解释外置\n＝ CBEC 的同构先例"},
		{"id":"i2","type":"text","x":2100,"y":210,"width":660,"height":190,"color":"4","text":"I2/I3｜FACS 心理测量评估\nSayette et al. 2001, J. Nonverbal Behavior 25:167-186\n专家 AU 级信度 ~0.80（Jeni/Cohn 2013）\n⭐你的 α≥0.80 门槛第三处独立印证"},
		{"id":"i3","type":"text","x":2100,"y":440,"width":660,"height":190,"color":"4","text":"I4｜双盲编码操作范本（行为科学标准流程）\n52% 双编码＋共识编码＋盲化（静音/随机/无接触）\nκ 分 AU 报告 0.50-0.85\n⭐你的双评流程与之逐字同构"},
		{"id":"i4","type":"text","x":2100,"y":670,"width":660,"height":190,"color":"4","text":"I5/I6｜生产先例 + AI 结构化线\nFACS→《Toy Story》面部合成（编码系统进动画工业）\nDiscoGraMS NAACL 2025 角色感知话语图\nKe Tian MIDA 2025 脚本六元组结构化"},
		{"id":"i_concl","type":"text","x":1560,"y":900,"width":420,"height":280,"color":"2","text":"★CBEC 非玄学·三层论证\n\n① 描述性：只编可观察行为\n（action/inference 分离，同 FACS）\n② 可靠性：端点信度可测（κ/α）\n③ 生产先例：FACS→Toy Story\n\n＝全身行为版 FACS，此格还空着"},
		{"id":"stop","type":"text","x":2100,"y":900,"width":660,"height":170,"color":"1","text":"STOP REACHED（2026-10-05）\n三轮扩散收口：增量临界 + 引文超版面 + RQ 稳定\n共 42 条目｜建议引用 +17"},
		{"id":"f_ipack","type":"file","file":"AI问题解决Canvas/行为编码先例_第3轮_STAGING.md","x":2100,"y":1110,"width":660,"height":170,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"merge","type":"text","x":540,"y":940,"width":680,"height":140,"color":"6","text":"合流点：范式 × 编码\n「practice-led 论文里，CBEC 是从创作实践\n中提炼的可判定知识——两层合法性互相支撑」"}
	],
